 we say works.","ar":"«عادةً» تعني كلّ يوم. لذلك نقول works."},"id":"L006"},{"actor":"maher","start":27.03,"text":{"en":"Tarek ____ (check) the tyres every day.","ar":"طارق ____ الإطارات كلّ يوم. الفعل: يفحص (check)."},"subHold":11.302,"id":"L007"},{"actor":"maher","start":38.332,"text":{"en":"Tarek checks the tyres every day.","ar":"طارق يفحص الإطارات كلّ يوم."},"id":"L008"},{"actor":"maher","start":41.562,"text":{"en":"Look! He ____ (change) the oil right now.","ar":"انظر! هو ____ الزيت الآن. الفعل: يغيّر (change)."},"subHold":12.619,"id":"L009"},{"actor":"maher","start":54.181,"text":{"en":"Look! He is changing the oil right now.","ar":"انظر! إنّه يغيّر الزيت الآن."},"id":"L010"},{"actor":"maher","start":58.635,"text":{"en":"The garage ____ (open) at eight o'clock.","ar":"الكراج ____ في الساعة الثامنة. الفعل: يفتح (open)."},"subHold":11.265,"id":"L011"},{"actor":"maher","start":69.9,"text":{"en":"The garage opens at eight o'clock.","ar":"الكراج يفتح في الساعة الثامنة."},"id":"L012"},{"actor":"maher","start":73.034,"text":{"en":"Today, Lina ____ (find) a fault in the engine.","ar":"اليوم، لينا ____ عطلاً في المحرّك. الفعل: تجد (find)."},"subHold":12.265,"id":"L013"},{"actor":"maher","start":85.299,"text":{"en":"Today, Lina is finding a fault in the engine.","ar":"اليوم، لينا تبحث عن عطل في المحرّك."},"id":"L014"},{"actor":"maher","start":89.201,"text":{"en":"Now choose: every day, or now?","ar":"الآن اختر: كلّ يوم، أم الآن؟"},"id":"L015"},{"actor":"maher","start":92.623,"text":{"en":"Right now, Tarek ____ (watches / is watching) Nabil.","ar":"الآن، طارق (يشاهد / يشاهد الآن) نبيل. أيّهما صحيح؟"},"subHold":12.549,"id":"L016"},{"actor":"maher","start":105.172,"text":{"en":"Right now, Tarek is watching Nabil.","ar":"الآن، طارق يشاهد نبيل."},"id":"L017"},{"actor":"maher","start":108.738,"text":{"en":"Lina usually ____ (starts / is starting) at eight.","ar":"لينا عادةً (تبدأ / تبدأ الآن) في الثامنة. أيّهما صحيح؟"},"subHold":12.263,"id":"L018"},{"actor":"maher","start":121.001,"text":{"en":"Lina usually starts at eight.","ar":"لينا تبدأ عادةً في الثامنة."},"id":"L019"},{"actor":"maher","start":124.111,"text":{"en":"Listen! The engine ____ (makes / is making) a strange noise.","ar":"استمع! المحرّك (يُصدر / يُصدر الآن) صوتاً غريباً. أيّهما صحيح؟"},"subHold":14.291,"id":"L020"},{"actor":"maher","start":138.402,"text":{"en":"Listen! The engine is making a strange noise.","ar":"استمع! المحرّك يُصدر صوتاً غريباً."},"id":"L021"},{"actor":"maher","start":143.264,"text":{"en":"The garage ____ (services / is servicing) many cars every week.","ar":"الكراج (يصون / يصون الآن) سيارات كثيرة كلّ أسبوع. أيّهما صحيح؟"},"subHold":13.676,"id":"L022"},{"actor":"maher","start":156.94,"text":{"en":"The garage services many cars every week.","ar":"الكراج يصون سيارات كثيرة كلّ أسبوع."},"id":"L023"}],"subtitles":{"enabled":true,"langs":"en,ar","show":null,"lang":{}},"badgePlacement":{"x":"0.016","y":"0.016","width":"0.205"},"audio":{"master":"audio.m4a","lines":[{"key":"d151f5932f8958b3","bytes":19296,"sha":"dfbb827359f21582","address":"lines/d151f5932f8958b3.mp3"},{"key":"f1c2ccfa9de7d37e","bytes":21744,"sha":"efc2fd8f1a9a102d","address":"lines/f1c2ccfa9de7d37e.mp3"},{"key":"1c31faf78d1ee691","bytes":18720,"sha":"87ddb18e162734f0","address":"lines/1c31faf78d1ee691.mp3"},{"key":"f899f63c3b980d05","bytes":28368,"sha":"830ac0a50342bfe8","address":"lines/f899f63c3b980d05.mp3"},{"key":"31a5a56947ceee6c","bytes":31104,"sha":"9f44ff4263d838f9","address":"lines/31a5a56947ceee6c.mp3"},{"key":"09f03bb28fb6c78a","bytes":27648,"sha":"c237ac8b5ec4f695","address":"lines/09f03bb28fb6c78a.mp3"},{"key":"e23925911862fed7","bytes":31104,"sha":"3c787a2d2e6708e1","address":"lines/e23925911862fed7.mp3"},{"key":"06f7c91447066147","bytes":17280,"sha":"976cdc2aaa69e503","address":"lines/06f7c91447066147.mp3"},{"key":"05eca9faaa88e207","bytes":38304,"sha":"f16a86b679343ffa","address":"lines/05eca9faaa88e207.mp3"},{"key":"cacc5a2291d21870","bytes":24624,"sha":"bf574a0eb50e7034","add